<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1150] ARFF Integration does not support quoted identifiers</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1150</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I ran the NSL-KDD data set (&lt;a href=&quot;http://nsl.cs.unb.ca/NSL-KDD/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://nsl.cs.unb.ca/NSL-KDD/&lt;/a&gt;) through the ARFF integration.  The process failed to parse the arff formatted file.  The file has quoted identifiers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;@relation &apos;KDDTrain-20Percent&apos;&lt;br/&gt;
@attribute &apos;duration&apos; real&lt;br/&gt;
@attribute &apos;protocol_type&apos; &lt;/p&gt;
{&apos;tcp&apos;,&apos;udp&apos;, &apos;icmp&apos;}
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The quotes caused the problem.  The &quot;official&quot; arff BNF shows that quotes should be supported:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://list.scms.waikato.ac.nz/mailman/htdig/wekalist/2008-January/012153.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://list.scms.waikato.ac.nz/mailman/htdig/wekalist/2008-January/012153.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;All&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
